: "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "241": {"changesets": [{"author": "Gijs Kruitbosch \u003cgijskruitbosch@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1692655. r=nika,mtigley,smaug a=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D144618", "files": ["browser/actors/AboutReaderParent.jsm", "toolkit/components/reader/AboutReader.jsm", "toolkit/components/reader/ReaderMode.jsm"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "f191afdbef72c51324100ecdafaa9a78e8a5f059", "parents": ["608b8cfa8ae8d5f49d8a83926806124d4c89bec8"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Andreas Farre \u003cfarre@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1755081 - Allow more containers to participate in FeaturePolicy r=smaug,ckerschb a=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D142216", "files": ["dom/base/Document.cpp", "dom/base/nsObjectLoadingContent.cpp", "dom/base/nsObjectLoadingContent.h"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "df568c5e2f372e1d510b8101e537af539ae28983", "parents": ["f191afdbef72c51324100ecdafaa9a78e8a5f059"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Lee Salzman \u003clsalzman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1766056 - Fix YUV color matrix for SWGL slow and fast paths. r=jrmuizel, a=RyanVM\n\nThe brush_yuv_image slow path expected a YUV color matrix that applies scaling,\nwhereas we set up a matrix for SWGL that had no scaling to support the fast path.\nTo work around the fact that both paths have different scaling requirements, we\npass the matrix with scaling down to the fast path and undo the scaling later\nwhen constructing SWGL's internal YUVMatrix from it. This allows both paths to\njust use the same matrix and avoids the footgun.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D144479", "files": ["gfx/wr/swgl/src/composite.h", "gfx/wr/swgl/src/swgl_ext.h", "gfx/wr/webrender/res/brush_yuv_image.glsl", "gfx/wr/webrender/res/composite.glsl"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "666429abbdbdbe33fcdc2519f52feb11954294df", "parents": ["df568c5e2f372e1d510b8101e537af539ae28983"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Emilio Cobos \u00c1lvarez \u003cemilio@crisal.io\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1760674. r=mak, a=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D141958", "files": ["docshell/base/BaseHistory.cpp", "dom/base/Link.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "6b9f8bda69c2a101076b7d7e3e7acf1cc7d16a58", "parents": ["666429abbdbdbe33fcdc2519f52feb11954294df"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Toshihito Kikuchi \u003ctkikuchi@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1752466 - Block WRusr.dll to stop the deadlock issue. r=haik, a=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D138668", "files": ["mozglue/dllservices/WindowsDllBlocklistDefs.in"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "118a67d861fce916722d477ba49935b234875ebe", "parents": ["6b9f8bda69c2a101076b7d7e3e7acf1cc7d16a58"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Edgar Chen \u003cechen@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1745915 - Add test for resizing a fullscreen window; r=smaug a=test-only\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D133742", "files": ["dom/html/test/file_fullscreen-resize.html", "dom/html/test/mochitest.ini", "dom/html/test/test_fullscreen-api.html"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "d18fef36c04a4b3069567dcc34ca3764d519a2cb", "parents": ["118a67d861fce916722d477ba49935b234875ebe"], "tags": []}], "date": 1650990336, "git_changesets": [null, null, null, null, null, null], "user": "ryanvm@gmail.com"}, "242": {"changesets": [{"author": "Stephen A Pohl \u003cspohl.mozilla.bugs@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1684739: Only check if swipe tracking is enabled on macOS if the event is a scrollwheel event. r=mstange, a=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D144728", "files": ["